  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A ball is dropped from height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. What is the time (in seconds) after which ball stops rebounding if the coefficient of restitution between ball and ground <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>?</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0027897_Ans.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 162px; height: 191px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">ev</mtext></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext></mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8658;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">gh</mtext></msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>3 s</mtext></math></p>",
